			"readme": [
				{
					"kind": "text",
					"text": "# @biopixi/core\n\nOffline grading primitives for biopixi.\n\nThe package parses "
				},
				{
					"kind": "code",
					"text": "`pixi.toml`"
				},
				{
					"kind": "text",
					"text": " and "
				},
				{
					"kind": "code",
					"text": "`pixi.lock`"
				},
				{
					"kind": "text",
					"text": ", classifies package-channel readiness, and computes\nthe deterministic BioContainers image name for an exact target set. It performs no network,\nsolver, package, or container operations.\n\n## Installation\n\n"
				},
				{
					"kind": "code",
					"text": "```bash\npnpm add @biopixi/core\n```"
				},
				{
					"kind": "text",
					"text": "\n\n## Usage\n\n"
				},
				{
					"kind": "code",
					"text": "```typescript\nimport { grade } from \"@biopixi/core\";\n\nconst result = grade(\".\");\nconsole.log(result.label, result.reasons);\n```"
				},
				{
					"kind": "text",
					"text": "\n\nThe normative policy is maintained in the repository's\n["
				},
				{
					"kind": "code",
					"text": "`PROFILE.md`"
				},
				{
					"kind": "text",
					"text": "](https://github.com/jmchilton/biopixi/blob/main/PROFILE.md). The current\nimplementation is still a prototype; known gaps are listed there."
				}
			]
		}
	],
